  "headline": "Villa takes legal action after Carragher remarks",
  "summary": "BBC Sport reports Aston Villa says it will begin legal action against Sky Sports pundit Jamie Carragher after comments about the club and its supporters. Carragher had argued Unai Emery might consider the Manchester United job and later told Villa fans to be quiet; he has since described the exchange as a joke and said he has long praised Villa and Emery.",
